1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,600
每次出门，你都要先掏出手机。
Every time you leave, you reach for your phone.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:14,200
可你的手，早就满了。
But your hands are already full.

3
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:24,200
识途。按一下，说去哪。
SHITU. Press once. Say where.

4
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,200
“去最近的地铁站。”
"Take me to the nearest subway."

5
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,600
“直走两百米。”
"Straight for 200 meters."

6
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:39,800
它只说一句：前面路口，右转。
It says one thing: turn right at the corner.

7
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:51,500
不掏手机，不看屏。
No phone. No screen.

8
00:00:52,200 --> 00:01:01,500
没信号，也认得回家的路。
No signal. Still knows the way home.

9
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:09,500
给不会用地图的人。
For people who don't use maps.

10
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:14,500
识途。Kickstarter 首发，129 美元起。
SHITU. Back us on Kickstarter. From $129.
